tom: 8px}\n.faq-content p {font-size: 14px;color: #554C48}\n.site-bottom-nav {position: fixed;bottom: 0;left: 0;right: 0;background: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.95);border-top: 1px solid #D6CBC1;padding: 14px 24px;display: flex;justify-content: center;gap: 28px;font-size: 13px;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.05em;z-index: 99}\n.site-bottom-nav a {color: #4A403D}\n.site-bottom-nav a:hover {color: #BA3D2B}\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .poster-meta {flex-direction: column;gap: 4px}\n  .plan-header-line {flex-direction: column;align-items: flex-start}\n  .plan-pricing {text-align: left}\n  .faq-row {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 8px}\n  .site-bottom-nav {justify-content: space-around;gap: 12px;font-size: 12px;padding: 12px 10px}\n}\n</style><main>\n  <header class=\"hero-poster\" id=\"manifesto\">\n    <div class=\"poster-meta\">\n      <span>Field Notes / Vol. 24</span>\n      <span>Network Architecture &amp; Subscriptions</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"editorial-note\">专栏随笔与规格归档</span>\n    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">星宝</h1>\n    <div class=\"hero-essay\">\n      <p>我们在屏幕前消耗的时间，往往受制于远方服务器那几百毫秒的迟疑。当信息的分发逐渐依赖穿透复杂拓扑的基础设施，人们对网络工具的期待反倒回归到了最质朴的维度：不必喧哗，但须始终有回音。</p>\n      <p>星宝在这里并不贩卖虚幻的数字神话。这是一套经过整理的连接目录，呈现可度量的带宽配额与按需分层的订阅构想，旨在为日常研发、文献查阅及跨境协作提供平实的工作底座。</p>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"section-block\" id=\"plans\">\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">\n      <div class=\"section-kicker\">Subscribed Tiers</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">订阅层级与配额清单</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">按工作负载与多端并发需求归纳的配置条目。列表展开了每一层级的可用额度与周期开销。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"plans-vertical-list\">\n      <article class=\"plan-row\">\n        <div class=\"plan-header-line\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name-wrap\">\n            <h3 class=\"plan-name\">基础版</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n            <div class=\"plan-price-main\">¥15/月</div>\n            <div class=\"plan-price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-detail-grid\">\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>每月 100GB 极速流量</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>支持 3 台设备同时在线</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>解锁基础流媒体</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>普通线路节点池</div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-row featured\">\n        <div class=\"plan-header-line\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name-wrap\">\n            <h3 class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</h3>\n            <span class=\"plan-badge\">推荐配置</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n            <div class=\"plan-price-main\">¥35/月</div>\n            <div class=\"plan-price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-detail-grid\">\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>每月 300GB 极速流量</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>支持 5 台设备同时在线</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>全节点原生流媒体解锁</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>7x24 优先工单支持</div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-row\">\n        <div class=\"plan-header-line\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name-wrap\">\n            <h3 class=\"plan-name\">团队版</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n            <div class=\"plan-price-main\">¥85/月</div>\n            <div class=\"plan-price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-detail-grid\">\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>每月 1000GB 极速流量</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>支持 20 台设备同时在线</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>VIP 专属高带宽节点</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>支持企业定制路由</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-feature-item\"><span class=\"plan-feature-dot\"></span>专属客户经理服务</div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section-block\" id=\"workflow\">\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">\n      <div class=\"section-kicker\">Deployment Guide</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">接入与日常使用路径</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">从选定资源到融入工作流，我们把过程拆解为直白的三个步骤，避免冗长的指令交互。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"steps-stack\">\n      <article class=\"step-item\">\n        <div class=\"step-order\">Phase 01</div>\n        <h3 class=\"step-title\">审视吞吐需求并完成凭证登记</h3>\n        <p class=\"step-desc\">依据同时工作的终端数量及月度数据吞吐，在星宝选择适宜的订阅层级。完成后系统将生成专属的配置文件索引地址。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"step-item\">\n        <div class=\"step-order\">Phase 02</div>\n        <h3 class=\"step-title\">载入通用网络中继客户端</h3>\n        <p class=\"step-desc\">将索引文本导入本地运行的开源或受信中继软件。星宝兼容业界通行的配置交换标准，支持路由规则自动分流。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"step-item\">\n        <div class=\"step-order\">Phase 03</div>\n        <h3 class=\"step-title\">验证链路延迟并开启按需代理</h3>\n        <p class=\"step-desc\">发起简单的往返时延测试，选择响应最平顺的接入点。建议设定规则模式，仅让跨域请求经由代理通道分发。</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section-block\" id=\"clients\">\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">\n      <div class=\"section-kicker\">Client Ecosystem</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">终端配套与协议适配说明</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">关于桌面端与移动设备的协作建议。星宝不绑定专有闭源程序，全面拥抱通用网络工具。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"client-notes\">\n      <article class=\"client-box\">\n        <h3 class=\"client-box-title\">桌面工作站（macOS / Windows / Linux）</h3>\n        <p class=\"client-box-text\">推荐采用支持自定义分流规则的成熟桌面客户端。借助星宝提供的订阅链接，可一键同步节点拓扑，按进程或目标域名分配流量走向。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"client-box\">\n        <h3 class=\"client-box-title\">移动设备（iOS / Android）</h3>\n        <p class=\"client-box-text\">移动端可配合系统网络扩展框架类工具使用。通过扫描二维码或粘贴配置链接导入，支持在蜂窝数据与无线局域网切换时保持会话状态。</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section-block\" id=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">\n      <div class=\"section-kicker\">Inquiries</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">常见疑问与查验记录</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">专栏作者收集并整理的代表性提问，提供没有修饰的技术回答。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-numbered-list\">\n      <article class=\"faq-row\">\n        <div class=\"faq-num\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3 id=\"q1\">星宝的流量额度如何进行周期性重置？</h3>\n          <p>所有订阅计划的流量均以月度为统计周期。每月在订阅生效日准时重置可用额度，当月未使用完毕的配额不累计至下一计费周期。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"faq-row\">\n        <div class=\"faq-num\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3 id=\"q2\">多设备同时在线限制是如何界定的？</h3>\n          <p>同时在线设备数是指同一时刻处于激活传输状态的独立物理终端数量。如果超出对应套餐的数量上限，后接入的连接将暂时无法通过节点交换数据。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"faq-row\">\n        <div class=\"faq-num\">03</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3 id=\"q3\">在日常使用中如何区分普通线路与专线优化？</h3>\n          <p>普通线路主要面向网页浏览、文档检索与常规媒体载入；旗舰版与团队版包含的专线节点在跨境公网抖动剧烈时具有更稳定的抖动表现，适合实时通信或网络协同。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"faq-row\">\n        <div class=\"faq-num\">04</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3 id=\"q4\">如果中途需要调整套餐规格，现有权益如何处理？</h3>\n          <p>可以在控制面板中发起升级操作，系统将根据当前计费周期的剩余可用天数折算差价，原有配置链接保持不变，仅需在本地客户端刷新配置即可。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<nav class=\"site-bottom-nav\">\n  <a href=\"#manifesto\">题记</a>\n  <a href=\"#plans\">订阅方案</a>\n  <a href=\"#workflow\">接入流程</a>\n  <a href=\"#clients\">客户端生态</a>\n  <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n</nav>",
